				Perform a powerful energy dash, immune to enemy projectile damage.
				Disable accessory visibility to use double-tap dash.
				Enable accessory visibility to use single-key dash.
				"This is the standard of the Elf Queen."
				'''
		}

		PowerJetPack: {
			DisplayName: Power Jet Pack
			Tooltip:
				'''
				Performs an extremely long, far, and fast electric dash.
				Immunity to all damage during the dash, dealing massive collision damage to enemies.
				20-second cooldown on the dash.
				"Martian technology, compressed dash."
				'''
		}

		ShallowOxygenBottle: {
